0.6 w 54.00 747.00 m 558.00 747.00 l S
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (answer styles, not simply different storage labels. Local retrieval emphasizes particulars; global retrieval) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (emphasizes themes; DRIFT generates a more detailed response through additional exploration. Lucek) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (explicitly describes graph methods and regular embeddings as complementary. Julien likewise argues that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (the benefits of graph relationships can be obtained through different underlying storage approaches.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (The sharpest agentic disagreement concerns how much machinery the problem deserves. Hey sidG) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (promotes an agent as the orchestrator, with RAG in its toolbox and a loop that retrieves, reads, critiques,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (and searches again when the evidence is insufficient. They also acknowledge the extra latency and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (compute from repeated thinking and retrieval [r4hp_y9_V3w @ 00:04:46]. Kaushal objects to skipping) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (directly from simple RAG to agentic RAG while ignoring intermediate choices such as better chunking,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (metadata, hybrid search, and reranking. If classic retrieval already solves the business problem, their) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (position is to keep it rather than move automatically to graphs or agents [cxGMp3DBkMk @ 00:18:36].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (Mirketa challenges another shortcut: agentic does not automatically mean autonomous. Alec describes) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (recommendation, preparation, reviewed action, and automatic action as different levels; Case Resolver) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (drafts responses and recommendations with human review for outgoing work [8N3k2qP_0SY @ 00:30:45].) Tj ET
